  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 8 Point Police / Security Cap is designed specifically for police officers, security guards, and other law enforcement personnel. The uniform cap&rsquo;s outer shell is constructed from durable polyester material, ensuring it withstands daily wear and tear while maintaining a professional appearance. The interior of the duty cap is made from nylon and features an inner sweatband for added comfort during long hours of duty. The service cap is equipped with an aluminum badge button, adding to its authoritative look. The black patent leather visor not only enhances the cap&rsquo;s aesthetic appeal but also provides practical sun protection. Available in a variety of sizes, this cap ensures a perfect fit for all users. Rothco&rsquo;s 8 Point Cap combines durability, comfort, and style, making it an essential piece of gear for anyone in public safety roles. Keep your look sharp and professional with this high-quality police and security cap.</p>",
